#: sl/SL_Menu.py:915
msgid "Switch off"
msgstr ""

#: sl/SL_Menu.py:917
msgid ""
"Encryption off. New changes are sent unencrypted; the key is kept so what is "
"already on the server stays readable."
msgstr ""

#: sl/SL_Menu.py:922
msgid "Forget key"
